# Vendored lintian Parity recipes ship cruft on purpose (editor backups,
# bytecode, dist/, *.egg-info, ...); keep all of it. Their .git/ directories
# are vendored as .git.vendored (see scripts/import_lintian_parity.py).
!packages/debmagic/tests/lintian-parity/**
